ont (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "Note" "Exact stocked PW24 part. DIR1=DIR2=HIGH gives four A-to-B and four B-to-A channels. Fourth forward channel is RXEN; NRESET uses a separate ground-referenced open-drain FET. Unused B8 grounded, A8 NC. VCCA=AON, VCCB=switched radio; guaranteed supply isolation below100mV, Ioff/IOZ max4uA perport -40..85C. All signal connections pass the actual buffer map. OE# defaults HIGH through R804 and may fall only on RUN_ALLOWED AND qualified radio PG. Decouple VCCA1 and VCCB23/24 locally; require cold native typed/package/pad proof and switched-off injection measurement. Configuredphysicalsymbol types explicitlyfixbits1:4A→B andbits5:8B→A from officialfunctiontable OELOW/DIR1HIGH/DIR2HIGH. Enforcedsourceguard pins2/11=AON_3V3/pin1=AON_3V3; OE reviewed RUN&PGdisable remains, bothrailoffisolation unchanged. ThusB8pin14 GND is a realunusedinput and A8pin10NC a realunusedoutput. IfeitherDIRnet changes, rejectconfiguredsymbol and rerun allroles/defaults. No blanketERCwaiver. A5/physical7 drives the MCU MISO through R825150ohm; MISO source damping is passive and does not change OE or rail-isolation authority. Physical9 DIO1 driver now feeds common22ohm R828.1 through2.3676mm F/B and the ordinary80.2,31.63 transition. R828.2 feeds unchanged U800 physical21/GPIO15 through the default In2/In3 receiver path. Direction and OE/startup safety logic remain unchanged; source damping and IRQ-register/level qualification are first-prototype provisions, not guaranteed loaded edge performance." (id 5) (at 416.56 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (id 6) (at 416.56 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "MPN" "SN74AXC8T245PWR" (id 7) (at 416.56 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (pin "2" (uuid 80aab400-7c92-4062-840d-872683827925)) (pin "3" (uuid af9b3d79-1e3e-4422-a20d-ab19d9f52319)) (pin "4" (uui